    "Send a brief": "Anfrage stellen",
    "An engineering studio building websites, online stores, backend, search and applied AI systems for product teams in Europe and the US.": "Ein Engineering-Studio für Websites, Onlineshops, Backend, Suche und angewandte KI – für Produktteams in Europa und den USA.",
